WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Priya Shah>Let's start with schedule. Handover is now forecast for 15 May, six weeks later than the re-baseline.</v>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:29.000
<v Liang Chen>The operator still hasn't confirmed the test windows. If we don't have them by 14 November we lose another month.</v>

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Priya Shah>So the decision we need is the £14m drawdown. Can finance confirm contingency after that?</v>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Ruth Dube>After the drawdown contingency would be about 2% of remaining work, below the 5% floor. That needs sponsor sign off.</v>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:06.000
<v Priya Shah>Agreed. Action: Ruth will draft the sponsor paper by Friday. Liang to chase the operator.</v>
